  "body": "Discover the pinnacle of modern comfort and style with this brand-new collection of standalone homes—crafted for those who expect more from their everyday. Here, impeccable design meets functional living, creating a sanctuary you’ll be proud to call home.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n• Contemporary Sophistication\r\nEnjoy light-filled, open-plan spaces, sleek finishes, and thoughtful details designed for effortless living and entertaining. Every home is fitted with built-in Bluetooth speakers. The development enjoys peaceful treetop views across many homes, with selected layouts capturing attractive sea views. Six distinct layouts are available, catering to a wide range of family needs.\r\n• Prime Location\r\nPerfectly placed in one of the North Shore’s most coveted neighbourhoods! A short drive to vibrant Torbay Village, the beautiful shores of Long Bay and Waiake Beach, and the convenience of nearby shopping and public transport.\r\n• Education Excellence\r\nZoned for top schools—Long Bay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College—offering your family outstanding educational opportunities right at your doorstep.\r\n• Lifestyle at Your Fingertips\r\nSpend weekends exploring golden beaches, scenic reserves, and local cafes—or simply relax in your stylish new haven. A wide driveway ensures smooth, easy vehicle access.\r\n\r\nDifferent layouts and Different options.\r\n• Lot 1: 131m2 (more or less) home offering 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n• Lot 2: 124m2 (more or less) home offering 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n• Lot 3: 127m2 (more or less) home offering 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n• Lot 4: 153m2 (more or less) home offering 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n• Lot 5: 184m2 (more or less) home offering 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n• Lot 6: 133m2 (more or less) home offering 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a single garage\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home—it’s a fresh start brimming with possibility, where every detail is designed for your comfort and enjoyment.\r\n\r\nThe opportunity to secure a property of this calibre in such a sought-after location is rare—don’t miss your chance!\r\n\r\nContact us today for a private viewing and experience the excitement of your next chapter. Your dream lifestyle awaits!",
